{
  "title": "修改表单",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>修改表单</h1>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">在树视图中展开<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">管理</span>文件夹。</p>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n        <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">点击<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">表单</span>节点，在主窗口中显示其默认页面。</p>\n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n          <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n            <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">从网格中选择一个表单行，然后点击主工具栏中的<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">编辑条目</span> <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"29\" src=\"/aras-images/image952.gif\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"25\">。随后将显示对话框窗口。</p>\n            <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n              <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">根据需要修改属性字段。</p>\n                <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                    <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">点击<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">保存、解锁、关闭</span> <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/aras-images/image953.gif\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"22\">。</p>\n                    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                      <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"572\" src=\"/aras-images/image961.gif\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"838\"></p>\n                      <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                        \n                        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                          \n                          \n\n</div></body></html>",
